From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:55:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 31/54] Read YAML with serde-saphyr

serde_norway, the first serde_yaml replacement, carries the same nine dangerous_implicit_autorefs errors as serde_yaml. serde-saphyr is pure Rust and forbids unsafe code. Skills, core-plugins and external-agent-migration read YAML through one helper that keeps serde_yaml's YAML 1.2 rules: only true and false are booleans, and numbers such as 0755 or 1_000 stay strings.
